When items are scattered around the room, just tap to collect them into the item bar above, sort them according to the target categories shown above—shirts, phones, snack bags, etc.—and gather the required quantities. Finish and you'll get the satisfying feeling of clearing the level. But if the temporary storage fills up and you can't place more items, the challenge ends early. You'll appreciate these details:
- Intuitive controls: tap-to-collect gives immediate visual feedback, so every tidy has a rhythmic feel;
